Description: FlowStation software-defined TETRA base station
 FlowStation TETRA base station (bluestation-bs) with a native Rust binary, a
 systemd service and a default configuration. Configure it from the web
 dashboard (http://flowstation.local once running). Requires a
 SoapySDR-supported SDR (SXceiver) on the device. Asterisk SIP/PSTN voice is not
 included in this package.

